    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's break down this tense kitchen conversation sentence by sentence.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Почему на кухне так тихо?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why is the kitchen so quiet?' Nastya wonders about the unusual silence among the kitchen staff this morning.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Шеф идёт.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef is coming.' Senya quietly warns her that their terrifying boss is on his way.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Опять злой.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Angry again.' He adds that the boss is in one of his notorious bad moods.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Что случилось?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened?' She asks what triggered the boss's fury this time.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Опять футбол?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Football again?' Nastya guesses that sports betting might be the cause again.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Да, вчера играл Спартак.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, yesterday Spartak played.' Senya confirms that a match involving a specific team took place the night before.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "И сколько он проиграл?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And how much did he lose?' She inquires about the financial damage the boss suffered.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Сто штук.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A hundred grand.' He reveals the massive sum of money lost on the bet.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Ничего себе!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Unbelievable!' Nastya is stunned by the sheer size of the gambling loss.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Сто тысяч рублей?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A hundred thousand rubles?' She repeats the amount just to make sure she heard it correctly.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Да, ровно сто тысяч.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, exactly one hundred thousand.' Senya confirms the exact devastating figure without hesitation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Они всегда проигрывают перед сменой.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They always lose before his shift.' He points out the recurring pattern of bad luck right before work.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "И что теперь делать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what do we do now?' She asks for advice on how to survive the upcoming storm.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Молчи и просто работай.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stay silent and just work.' Senya recommends keeping their heads down and focusing purely on tasks.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Не зли шефа сегодня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not anger the chef today.' He specifically warns against doing anything that might set the boss off.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Понятно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Understood.' Nastya acknowledges the survival strategy for the day.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Буду очень осторожной.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will be very careful.' She promises to tread lightly around the explosive head cook.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "За работу!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
